{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-workouttracker01",
    "name": "Workout Tracker \u2014 API Gateway",
    "description": "Master collection for Workout Tracker.\n\n**All requests go through the API Gateway only** (`{{gatewayBaseUrl}}`).\n\n## Setup\n1. Import this collection and `Workout-Tracker.local.postman_environment.json`.\n2. Select the **Workout Tracker \u2014 Local** environment.\n3. Set `firebaseToken` to a valid Firebase ID token.\n4. Run **Users \u2192 Create Profile** once per Firebase user, then use the rest.\n\n## Extending\nAdd new requests under the matching service folder. Keep paths under `/api/v1/...` so they stay gateway-routed.\n\n| Folder | Gateway path | Upstream |\n|--------|--------------|----------|\n| Users | `/api/v1/users/**` | :8081 |\n| Workouts | `/api/v1/workouts/**` | :8082 |\n| Progress | `/api/v1/progress/**`, `/api/v1/body-measurements/**` | :8083 |\n| Nutrition | `/api/v1/nutrition/**`, `/api/v1/water/**` | :8084 |\n| Notifications | `/api/v1/notifications/**` | :8085 |\n| Gateway | actuator / health | :8080 |",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{firebaseToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "gatewayBaseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "apiVersion",
      "value": "v1"
    },
    {
      "key": "workoutId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "weightLogId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "bodyMeasurementId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "personalRecordId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "mealId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "waterLogId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "notificationId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
